@startuml payment-state
' State of a Payment (domain.booking.Payment). Every transition is a method on Payment;
' any transition not drawn here throws IllegalStateException. Keep in sync with PaymentTest.
hide empty description

[*] --> INITIATED : Payment.initiate(holder, last4, amount)\n[card details valid]

INITIATED --> AUTHORIZED : authorize()\n[issuer approves]
INITIATED --> FAILED : fail()\n[issuer declines: number ends in 0002]
AUTHORIZED --> COMPLETED : complete(paidAt)
AUTHORIZED --> FAILED : fail()
COMPLETED --> REFUNDED : refund(refundedAt)\n[reservation cancelled or flight archived]

FAILED --> [*] : nothing is saved
COMPLETED --> [*] : saved with its reservation
REFUNDED --> [*]

note right of INITIATED
  In memory only. Invalid card details
  (Luhn, expiry, CVV, name) fail validation
  before a Payment is created.
end note

note right of COMPLETED
  Only COMPLETED and REFUNDED are stored
  (payments.status CHECK). Stored: cardholder
  name, last 4 digits, amount, timestamps.
end note
@enduml
